OL,3,AAlmost half of households do not see
OL,4,Abenefits of economic growth, report
OL,5,Asays
OL,6,
OL,7,FAlmost half of people in Britain live
OL,8,Fin areas where economic growth does not
OL,9,Ftranslate into a better quality of life
OL,10,Fwith a "stark" North-South divide in
OL,11,Fthe spending power of households, a new
OL,12,Freport finds.
OL,14,FResearchers at consultancy firm PwC
OL,15,Fsaid every region the north of England,
OL,16,Fmidlands and Wales had a lower spending
OL,17,Fpower than the country's average, with
OL,18,FLondon and the South East comfortably
OL,19,Fabove.
